          "text": "<p>A project manager has broken down a project into $8$ tasks: $A, B, C, D, E, F, G,$ and $H$. The dependencies between the tasks are shown in the directed graph below. A valid \"work plan\" is any sequence of tasks that respects all dependencies (i.e., a topological ordering).</p><p>The dependencies are as follows:<br><br>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"312\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></p><p>How many distinct valid work plans exist for this project?</p>",
